 you create the configurations yourself? \n\n`Version Pre` and everything with `.web / .linux / .windows / .macos` at the end or do you use addons for that? I don't have these configurations. That's why I think we can only validate the official configurations, and not the configurations inserted by addons.\n\n\n> It works without user:// but I have two questions:\n> \n> * why is this settings used on my dev platform, I thought it was only for exported version using macos flag\n> * will my exported macos version still work on player's hardware ?\n\n\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8b85c877-a7d0-4e7f-9f33-acbf8b934096)\n\n","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2692953054/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2692974123","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103367#issuecomment-2692974123","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103367","id":2692974123,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6gg4Yr","user":{"login":"Alex2782","id":41921395,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxOTIxMzk1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41921395?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782","html_url":"https://github.com/Alex2782","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-02T23:48:58Z","updated_at":"2025-03-02T23:53:54Z","body":"Maybe tag `good first issue`.\n\nI couldn't find any validations in the \"Project Settings\" dialog. I think everything will only be validated when the project is started.\n\n-------------\n\n`EditorNode::get_singleton()->ensure_main_scene`\nSearch for these lines as an example. This function validates the configuration `application/run/main_scene` whether the path is valid.\n\n\n\n\n","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2692974123/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2706682321","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103367#issuecomment-2706682321","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103367","id":2706682321,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6hVLHR","user":{"login":"runbozhuang","id":13036245,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzMDM2MjQ1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13036245?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/runbozhuang","html_url":"https://github.com/runbozhuang","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/runbozhuang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/runbozhuang/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/runbozhuang/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/runbozhuang/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/runbozhuang/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/runbozhuang/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/runbozhuang/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/runbozhuang/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/runbozhuang/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-07T15:06:39Z","updated_at":"2025-03-07T15:13:35Z","body":"> Maybe tag `good first issue`.\n> \n> I couldn't find any validations in the \"Project Settings\" dialog. I think everything will only be validated when the project is started.\n> \n> `EditorNode::get_singleton()->ensure_main_scene` Search for these lines as an example. This function validates the configuration `application/run/main_scene` whether the path is valid.\n\n@Alex2782  I would like to take a look this issue, before that I want to confirm a bit more since I am new to this repo \nSo now the goal is:\nvalidating the **user_data_dir** path in **ensure_main_scene** method ? \n\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2706682321/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2706819078","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103367#issuecomment-2706819078","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103367","id":2706819078,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6hVsgG","user":{"login":"Alex2782","id":41921395,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxOTIxMzk1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41921395?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782","html_url":"https://github.com/Alex2782","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-07T15:55:53Z","updated_at":"2025-03-07T15:55:53Z","body":"Use the function `ensure_main_scene` only as an example how and where the project settings are checked.\nMy suggestion would be a new validation function. For example `validate_custom_directory`.\n\n\n1. if [use_custom_user_dir](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/classes/class_projectsettings.html#class-projectsettings-property-application-config-use-custom-user-dir) == true, then check [custom_user_dir_name](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/classes/class_projectsettings.html#class-projectsettings-property-application-config-custom-user-dir-name)\n2. if `custom_user_dir_name.left(7) == \"user://\"` or `custom_user_dir_name.left(6) == \"res://\"`, then display an error message that this is not allowed.\n\nBut whether this solution is acceptable will probably be decided by others, who will certainly give you further assistance.\n\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/aca648fc-5087-4724-80c3-488eb89b841a)","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2706819078/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2737501445","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103367#issuecomment-2737501445","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103367","id":2737501445,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6jKvUF","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-19T17:34:22Z","updated_at":"2025-03-19T17:37:17Z","body":"I can't reproduce the bug on Windows, although this is likely due to DirAccess platform differences. When I put `user://` into the custom dir name, it gets sanitized into `user-//`, which creates a valid path.\n\nEDIT:\nActually, the folder exists and I can navigate to it, but I still get the shader cache error. Looks like shader cache is doing something differently.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2737501445/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2740413595","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103367#issuecomment-2740413595","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103367","id":2740413595,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6jV2Sb","user":{"login":"Alex2782","id":41921395,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxOTIxMzk1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41921395?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782","html_url":"https://github.com/Alex2782","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-20T13:12:27Z","updated_at":"2025-03-20T13:17:25Z","body":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103367#issuecomment-2692953054\n`.web / .linux / .windows / .macos`\n\n\n@KoBeWi Do you know if these settings are officially supported by the engine?\nAfter a quick search I couldn't find anything in the sources.\n\n------------------\n\n`application/config/custom_user_dir_name`\n\nWhen users enter `user://` there, they probably expect the path to be absolute. But that doesn't work (on MacOS).\n\n```gdscript\n\tProjectSettings.set_setting(\"application/config/use_custom_user_dir\", true)\n\t\n\tProjectSettings.set_setting(\"application/config/custom_user_dir_name\", \"test\")\n\tprint(\"1) get_user_data_dir: \", OS.get_user_data_dir())\n\n\tProjectSettings.set_setting(\"application/config/custom_user_dir_name\", \"test/test2\")\n\tprint(\"2) get_user_data_dir: \", OS.get_user_data_dir())\n\n\tProjectSettings.set_setting(\"application/config/custom_user_dir_name\", \"user://test\")\n\tprint(\"3) get_user_data_dir: \", OS.get_user_data_dir())\n```\n\n**output:**\n```\n1) get_user_data_dir: /Users/alex/Library/Application Support/test\n2) get_user_data_dir: /Users/alex/Library/Application Support/test/test2\n3) get_user_data_dir: /Users/alex/Library/Application Support/user-//test\n```\n\n------------------\n\n`//` is an invalid path to write\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/4c311cbee68c0b66ff8ebb8b0defdd9979dd2a41/servers/rendering/renderer_rd/shader_rd.cpp#L508-L512\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/bdcc5766-18bb-4a8e-8fe8-88a09071872f)\n\n\n","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2740413595/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2740562487","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103367#issuecomment-2740562487","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103367","id":2740562487,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6jWao3","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-20T14:01:02Z","updated_at":"2025-03-20T14:01:02Z","body":"> Do you know if these settings are officially supported by the engine?\nAfter a quick search I couldn't find anything in the sources.\n\nThey are overrides. You can create them using this list:\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5bc0ea75-ed27-4ddf-afe8-372eb5561392)\n\nThe engine will pick a value based on active feature tags, so you can customize different values based on platform, whether running a debug build etc.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2740562487/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]